cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its planning rules in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Pantry: a self hosted meal planner, pantry and shopping list for the home server"
abstract: >-
  Self hosted household app that plans meals from the dishes a household cooks, simulates the stock through the
  plan, derives a rounded shopping list, costs every meal from first in first out purchase batches and reports
  nutrition per person. A large language model only classifies and describes ingredients and dishes; its
  answers are validated against a schema and numeric bounds.
type: software
authors:
